# `agents.harnesses`

Enumerate known harnesses (claude, openai, gemini, ...).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`HarnessesResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `string[]` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.harnesses --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    "claude",
    "claude-code",
    "shell"
  ]
}
```
